<header><p class="enc-kicker">People / group</p><h1 class="enc-title">Argonauts</h1></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">The Argonauts were the band of heroes in Greek mythology who sailed with <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/jason">Jason</a> on the ship <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/argo">Argo</a> to Colchis, on the eastern shore of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/black-sea">Black Sea</a>, to fetch the Golden Fleece. With the help of the Colchian princess Medea they took the fleece from King Aeetes. The story, told most fully in the Argonautica of Apollonius of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/rhodes">Rhodes</a>, shaped Greek ideas of Colchis as a land of gold.</p></div>
